    "body": "Fixes the \\`:intel: (BMG) V1 spec decode\\` failure in [Intel CI build 14745](https://buildkite.com/vllm/intel-ci/builds/14745#01a15710-5cab-497a-b763-9bf4277ad977): #52670 moved \\`is_quantized_kv_cache\\` to \\`vllm.v1.kv_cache_interface\\`, but \\`vllm/models/step5/nvidia/sparse_attention.py\\` still imported it from \\`vllm.utils.torch_utils\\`, raising \\`ImportError\\` during kernel warmup. No open PR addresses this.\n\nValidation:\n- \\`ruff check\\` / \\`ruff format --check\\` on the file — passed\n- \\`python -c \"import vllm.models.step5.nvidia.sparse_attention\"\\` — imports cleanly\n- \\`tests/v1/e2e/spec_decode/draft_model/test_draft_model.py::test_draft_model_tensor_parallelism\\` not run locally (no XPU/GPU); relying on CI.\n\nAI assistance was used.",
